<h1>Family Together Platform: Frontend 10 Per Page Audit & Certification</h1>
<p><strong>Generated Date:</strong> October 14, 2026 | <strong>Status:</strong> <span class="badge-success">COMPLETED & VERIFIED (0 TypeScript Errors)</span></p>

<div class="box-info">
  <strong>Executive Summary:</strong><br>
  All frontend tabs and list pages across Owner Dashboard and Admin Dashboard have been standardized to show <strong>10 items per page</strong> (<code>limit = 10</code>, <code>defaultLimit: 10</code>). Every corresponding GET API receives <code>page</code> and <code>limit=10</code> parameters along with debounced, whitespace-trimmed <code>search</code> parameters.
</div>

