<h2>2. 2D Interactive Family Tree Canvas Protection</h2>
<div class="box-tree">
  <strong>Guaranteed Tree Canvas Integrity:</strong><br>
  Unlike the tables and grid cards, the 2D Interactive Family Tree Canvas (<code>InteractiveFamilyTreeCanvas.tsx</code> and <code>LandingFamilyTreeCanvas.tsx</code>) requires access to the complete graph of relatives and ties to draw SVG connection lines (parent, child, spouse, sibling) without severed links.<br><br>
  The tree canvas queries use <code>useGetMembersQuery(undefined)</code> and <code>useGetRelationshipsQuery(undefined)</code>. In <code>familyApi.ts</code>, when parameters are undefined, the requests send:
  <ul>
    <li><code>/family/members?paginate=false</code></li>
    <li><code>/family/relationships?paginate=false</code></li>
  </ul>
  The backend NestJS controller detects <code>paginate=false</code> and returns all nodes (capped at 1,000 for safety), ensuring <strong>zero broken lines</strong> while all other dashboard tabs display exactly 10 items per page.
</div>

<h2>3. Pagination Controls & URL Sync Features</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Synchronized URL Parameters:</strong> When navigating pages or searching, URL query parameters (e.g. <code>?page=2&limit=10&search=john</code>) update via HTML5 <code>replaceState</code> without reloading the page or causing input focus loss.</li>
  <li><strong>First / Prev / Next / Last Buttons:</strong> Complete navigation controls rendered via <code>PaginationControls.tsx</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Per-Page Dropdown Selector:</strong> Users can optionally switch between 10, 20, or 50 items per page.</li>
  <li><strong>Debounced Search:</strong> Typing in search fields debounces by 300ms, trims whitespace, and automatically resets the current page back to 1.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Compilation & Quality Verification</h2>
<p>The entire frontend codebase was validated using the Next.js TypeScript compiler:</p>
<code>npx tsc --noEmit</code>
<p><strong>Result:</strong> <code>The command exited with code 0</code> (No compilation errors, clean build).</p>

